# A diff between 1 MiB and 5 MiB opens without syntax highlight and without a "too large" notice.
# Shift+L has no diff to load there, so it runs the pull key. The repository has no upstream, so the pull fails.
fixture middiff
wait text "Working Changes"
click 60 4
wait text "Unstaged files"
click 126 6
wait text "value_000000"
snapshot over-highlight-limit
key L
wait text "no tracking information"
snapshot after-shift-l
